# Repo-root ignores for the TEMPLATE PACK project.
# The template body under template/ ships its own .gitignore — that one is scaffolded into every
# new library and must not be confused with this file. Patterns here are deliberately minimal:
# the only thing that builds at this level is the template packaging project.

# Build output (this project's, and any left in the template body by a local test build)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/

# The packed template itself
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Rider / VS Code
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Local scaffolding smoke tests (see README: dotnet new dmnsn-lib -o .scaffold-test)
.scaffold-test/

# Environment / secrets
*.env
